WRECKING BALL - MILEY CYRUS
4/4

intro 4
| Dm / | !F / | !C / | Gm / |

vs 4
|: Dm / | !F / | !C / | Gm / :|x2

[Prechorus] 5
|: !Bb / | Dm / | !F / | !Bb / :|x2
    | ^"HOLD" !Bb / |

ch 6
|: ^"BAND IN" !F / | !C / | Dm / | !Bb / :|x2
    | ^"TAG" Dm / | !Bb / |

vs 4
|: Dm / | !F / | !C / | Gm / :|x2

[Prechorus] 4
|: !Bb / | Dm / | !F / | !Bb / :|x2

[Double Chorus] 6
|: !F / | !C / | Dm / | !Bb / :|x4
    | ^"TAG" Dm / | !Bb / |

br 8
|: !Bb / | r1 | Dm / | r1 |
    | !F / | r1 | Am / | r1 :|x4

vs 5
| ^"DOWN" Dm / | !F / | !C / | Gm / |
    | r1 |

ch 6
|: !F / | !C / | Dm / | !Bb / :|x4
    |: ^"TAG" Dm / | !Bb / :|x2
